Keep a shared seen as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared digits as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared foundat as 0.
To find from spot (a whole number) with target (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of seen, return.
If item spot of seen is target, set foundat to spot, return.
Find from spot plus 1 with target.

The numerator is 1.
The denominator is 6.
The sign is 1.
If numerator is less than 0, set sign to -1.
The top is numerator times sign.
The bottom is denominator.
The whole is top divided by bottom.
The remainder is top modulo bottom.
The result is format whole number whole as text.
If sign is -1, The mark is empty text, Place "-" into mark, Place mark into result.
The cycle is -1.
If remainder is more than 0, Place "." into result.
Repeat while remainder is more than 0.
Set foundat to -1.
Find from 0 with remainder.
If foundat is at least 0, set cycle to foundat, break.
Place remainder into seen.
The digit is remainder times 10 divided by bottom.
The piece is format whole number digit as text.
Place piece into digits.
Set remainder to remainder times 10 modulo bottom.

The lastdigit is the last position of digits.
For every spot from 0 to lastdigit.
If spot is cycle, Place "(" into result.
Place item spot of digits into result.

If cycle is at least 0, Place ")" into result.
Show result.
